  91: -- ============================================================================
  92: -- 2) get_unread_counts: unread follows receipts above the historical floor.
  93: --    Same signature, return type, and parameter names as 20260610210000, so
  94: --    CREATE OR REPLACE keeps the existing ACL. The anti-join uses the unique
