.planning\ROADMAP.md:7:This roadmap tracks the remaining v1 delivery of a brownfield Virtual Office application. 
Stabilization, floor-plan completion, Presence reload fixes, Knock, and spatial audio/screen sharing, and Messaging 
Timeline are complete for phase routing; the next phase is Messaging Resilience. The journey starts with stabilizing 
broken functionality (auth, floor plan sizing, avatar debt), then completes remaining floor plan features, immediately 
follows with a reliable spatial-audio and screen-sharing demonstration that leverages the existing WebRTC foundation, 
then rounds out messaging features and resilience, and finishes with meeting intelligence and company announcements. 
Each phase delivers a coherent, verifiable capability that builds on the previous.
.planning\ROADMAP.md:19:- [x] **Phase 2: Floor Plan Completion** - Deliver remaining spatial features: knock-to-enter, 
offline removal, default spaces, reconnection (completed 2026-05-13)
.planning\ROADMAP.md:20:- [x] **Phase 2.1: Presence Reload Fixes (INSERTED)** - Fix remaining presence reload bugs: 
lastSpaceId persistence and UI/DB divergence
.planning\ROADMAP.md:22:- [x] **Phase 4: Messaging Timeline** - Reader/time details, usable attachments, voice notes, 
starred-message filter, plus desktop notifications and failed-send preservation (owner accepted 2026-10-06; app not 
yet deployed)
