spec-interview/phase-5-messaging-resilience\reviews\sol-review-plan-r1.md:26:   T13 expressly requires 
application-owned recovery after errors, timeouts, and terminal closures with capped exponential backoff—but only for 
messages/list. T15 says typing “recovers after drops”; its verification lists a typing-only drop without 
terminal-closure or increasing-delay evidence. SDK socket recovery could satisfy that test while application recovery 
from a terminal typing-channel closure remains absent. The current typing hook only clears its subscribed flag on 
failure ([useConversationPresence.ts:150](E:/projects/virtual-office/src/hooks/useConversationPresence.ts:150)).  
spec-interview/phase-5-messaging-resilience\reviews\sol-review-plan-r1.md:55:    **Smallest fix:** prove a 
